# The third-party data bundled into lockra-autofill, one file per line: its path under data/, its
# SHA-256, and the URL it is downloaded from, at a fixed commit where the source has commits.
# scripts/update-vendored-data.sh is the only way to change these files: it downloads every file
# and refuses the lot unless each one has the SHA-256 written here. A test (src/data.rs) checks the
# embedded files against the same lines, so a reformatted or edited file fails the build.
#
# To move to a newer upstream commit: put it in the URLs, run the script, read the upstream
# change between the two commits, then pin the SHA-256 values the script printed and run it again.

